      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Ranged Weapon Attack: +8 to hit, range 30/90 ft., one target. Hit: 7 (2d6) fire damage, and the target gains one level of burning. This weapon has the heavy, reload (3, action), two-handed, strength 13 properties.</p><p><strong>Spray.</strong> Once per turn, the pyromaniac can replace one of its weapon attacks with a spray of fire in a 15-foot cone. Each creature in the cone must make a DC 16 Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 7 (2d6) fire damage and gains one level of burning. On a successful save, it takes half as much damage and doesn't gain a level of burning.</p>",
          "chat": ""
